+.Fl -rootdir .
+Patterns starting with an exclamation mark negate a previous match and the
+last matching pattern wins;
+.Sq *
+overwrites every conflicting file.
+Conflicts that do not match are still errors.
+A directory is never replaced by a file, nor a file by a directory.
+This option can be specified multiple times and adds to the
+.Sy overwrite
